# Data Analyst Project – Banking Industry

This folder contains data analysis case studies related to the **banking industry**.

The purpose of this project is to practice analyzing financial/customer data and understand how data is used to support decision-making in the banking sector.

---

## Objectives
- Develop analytical thinking in a banking context
- Understand customer and financial data analysis
- Generate insights to support business decisions

---

## Scope of Work
- Data cleaning and preprocessing
- Data exploration and basic analysis
- Simple data visualization

---

## Tools Used
- Excel / Spreadsheet
- Power BI
- Python (optional)
- SQL (optional)

---

This project is part of my learning journey in Data Analysis and will continue to be updated with new case studies.
